    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section__inner">
    <h2 class="home-section__title">How It Works</h2>
    <div class="method-cards">
      <div class="method-card">
        <span class="method-card__number">1</span>
        <h3 class="method-card__title">You Read the Script</h3>
        <p class="method-card__text">Each lesson tells you exactly what to say and do. No teaching experience needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="method-card">
        <span class="method-card__number">2</span>
        <h3 class="method-card__title">The Reader Follows the Pointer</h3>
        <p class="method-card__text">An animated red dot guides the reader through each sound, blending letters into words.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="method-card">
        <span class="method-card__number">3</span>
        <h3 class="method-card__title">Practice Makes Progress</h3>
        <p class="method-card__text">Short daily sessions build reading skills through structured repetition and immediate feedback.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section home-section--alt">
  <div class="home-section__inner">
    <h2 class="home-section__title">Lesson Phases</h2>
    <p class="home-section__subtitle">150 structured lessons across 7 phases, from first sounds to fluent reading.</p>
    <div class="phase-cards">
      <a href="/phases/phase-1/" class="phase-card">
        <span class="phase-card__badge">Phase 1</span>
        <h3 class="phase-card__title">Foundation</h3>
        <p class="phase-card__desc">Lessons 1&ndash;20. First sounds (m, s, a, ē, t, r, d, i, th, c) and first words.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/phases/phase-2/" class="phase-card">
        <span class="phase-card__badge">Phase 2</span>
        <h3 class="phase-card__title">Building</h3>
        <p class="phase-card__desc">Lessons 21&ndash;40. More sounds (o, n, f, u, l, w, g, sh, ā, h) and sentences.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/phases/phase-3/" class="phase-card">
        <span class="phase-card__badge">Phase 3</span>
        <h3 class="phase-card__title">Expanding</h3>
        <p class="phase-card__desc">Lessons 41&ndash;75. All remaining sounds including digraphs, long vowels, and blends.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/phases/phase-4/" class="phase-card">
        <span class="phase-card__badge">Phase 4</span>
        <h3 class="phase-card__title">Vowel Teams</h3>
        <p class="phase-card__desc">Lessons 76&ndash;88. Vowel teams (ea, ai) and comprehensive review.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/phases/phase-5/" class="phase-card">
        <span class="phase-card__badge">Phase 5</span>
        <h3 class="phase-card__title">Patterns &amp; Rules</h3>
        <p class="phase-card__desc">Lessons 89&ndash;100. Diphthongs, r-controlled or, ck, unvoiced th, short oo.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/phases/phase-6/" class="phase-card">
        <span class="phase-card__badge">Phase 6</span>
        <h3 class="phase-card__title">Blends &amp; Advanced</h3>
        <p class="phase-card__desc">Lessons 101&ndash;125. Consonant blends, vowel patterns, -ed suffix, soft c/g.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/phases/phase-7/" class="phase-card">
        <span class="phase-card__badge">Phase 7</span>
        <h3 class="phase-card__title">Mastery</h3>
        <p class="phase-card__desc">Lessons 126&ndash;150. Remaining blends, suffixes, syllable types, graduation.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="home-section__inner" style="text-align:center">
    <h2 class="home-section__title">Independent Reading</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:var(--space-lg);max-width:32rem;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">Once the learner has completed a few lessons, they can practice reading on their own with our collection of stories.</p>
    <a href="/stories/" class="btn btn--cta">Browse Stories</a>
  </div>
</section>